# The image builds from source; anything generated, installed, or secret stays out.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
infra/.env
infra/.env.*
!infra/.env.example
!infra/.env.production.example

# Rendered Telegraf configuration carries injected SNMP credentials and is
# produced at runtime into a mounted volume, never baked into an image.
infra/runtime

.git
.gitignore
*.md
!README.md
